            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em">
                How your donation makes an impact
            </h1>
            <p>When you contribute by donating a water pump or helping build a well for communities that struggle to access safe drinking water, you're making a life-changing impact.</p>
            <p>Water is the essence of life, and when you support communities in constructing and restoring infrastructure for clean, safe drinking water and sanitation, you're not just providing the means for survival; you're also shielding them from numerous dangers associated with water scarcity.</p>
            <p>Our initiatives not only bring clean water to communities for temporary use but also address food insecurity by watering crops and fields. The ripple effect of your donation goes beyond, making a significant and lasting difference.</p>

        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
    </div>
    @*END SECTION IMPACT OF DONATION*@


    <div class="col-md-3"></div>
    <div class="col-md-6 " style="text-align:justify;font-size:18px;">
        <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em">
            Building water wells
        </h1>
        <p>
            Communities around the world are deprived of readily available clean water. What this means is that people must travel long distances to get clean water for their day-to-day needs. To combat this issue, Human Relief Mission builds wells in communities where the struggle for clean water is most needed.
        </p>
        <p>By drilling wells, we aim to bring this essential resource closer to those who need it the most. This not only reduces the burden of long journeys but also ensures that communities have a reliable and nearby source of clean water for their daily necessities.  Your support in our water aid programs makes a great difference, transforming the lives of these communities and fostering a future where access to clean water is a fundamental right, not a distant dream.</p>

        <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em">
            Water Tankers
        </h1>
        <p>In areas where there is an emergency need for water, building water wells can take some time. To combat the immediate need for water for some communities, Human Relief Mission dispatches water tankers. By doing so, we strive to bridge the gap between the communities and the vital resources they require. Sending water tankers not only helps the immediate struggle for water but also ensures that these areas have a consistent and accessible supply for their daily needs.</p>
        <p>
            <img src="~/Content/projects/water-aid/water-tanker.jpg" style="width:100%;" />
        </p>
    </div>
